          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Technical specs",
            "open_as_drawer": false,
            "icon": "icon-caret__right",
            "content": "<ul><li>Exact dimensions</li><li>Weight</li><li>Compatibility (e.g., tech specs, supported devices)</li><li>Certifications (e.g., organic, CE, ISO)</li></ul><h6>Why It Matters:</h6><ul><li>Enables comparison and decision-making</li><li>Crucial for high-involvement purchases&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Utilize metafield (connect to dynamic source) to make the content dynamic.</p>",
