        "testimonial_h9G3CD": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "Perfect daypack for everyday carry",
            "testimonial": "<p>I’ve been using this backpack as my daily carry bag, and it’s absolutely brilliant. Compact, tough, and surprisingly spacious for its size. It fits my water bottle, lunch, tools, and even a small tablet with no problem. The MOLLE webbing makes it super customizable. Can’t recommend it enough for urban or light outdoor use!</p>",
            "author": "Marko Mäkinen"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_hiwA6r": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "Ideal for short hikes and versatile use",
            "testimonial": "<p>This backpack its the sweet spot between size and functionality. I’ve taken it on weekend hikes and as a travel companion—it performs flawlessly. It’s built like a tank, comfortable to wear for long stretches, and the internal frame adds excellent support. Definitely worth every penny!</p>",
            "author": "Just Me"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Hkp7Kp": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "Serious gear for serious adventures",
            "testimonial": "<p>I’ve used this backpack on multi-day treks and it’s a beast. The build quality is outstanding—everything from the zippers to the straps feels durable and reliable. The side pouch system and internal organization make packing efficient. It’s the best large pack I’ve ever owned for backcountry trips.</p>",
            "author": "Mike Hiker"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_JQrJFV": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "The ultimate load hauler",
            "testimonial": "<p>If you need a pack that can handle serious gear and harsh conditions, this is it. I use it for hunting and winter expeditions—it swallows everything I throw at it and distributes weight beautifully. The modular design lets me adapt it to any mission. Truly a professional-grade backpack.</p>",
            "author": "Author's name"
          }
        }
      },
